{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026WnG10VFJiH1795258940.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>男子網球年終賽，美維迪夫擊敗迪亞科，小組次名晉級四強。</p><p></p><p>同組的艾卡拉斯已肯定晉級，藍衫的美維迪夫與迪亞科爭最後一席。首盤在第六局造出破發，「一發」得分率有七成七，開出15次「ACE」，美維迪夫面對迪亞科兩個破發分，都成功挽救，先贏6-3。</p><p></p><p>第二盤打到第九局，美維迪夫再次打破發球局，贏多盤6-4，直落兩盤勝出，四強對「一哥」施華利夫。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T12:23:57.087302+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T11:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T22:12:39.277190+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T12:17:19.344785+00:00","content_hash":"d6c87cec8b9149911f316622924f5bdcd735af1f428d0f9c0131808ff980beaa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}